    "title": "Mad Smash",
    "description": "Mad Smash is addictive and fun game that lets you smash your way against the stacked tower. try to avoid the blocks and time your movement to advance to the next level!\r\n\r\nKeep an eye for the booster counter, when you go through many stacks without failing you will get the fireball, the fireball is not affected with blocks but be careful, the booster fireball is only active for a brief period of time.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the mad ball and smash your way down the blocks!",
